                            	  4694:     ; I don't know why the object timer of the tail segment that will
                            	  4695:     ; be made dead is set to $11. By setting its object type to $5D
                            	  4696:     ; below, its metastate will become $10 -- dying/dead. From
                            	  4697:     ; there, the object timer is set to 6.
                            	  4698:     ;
