                            	  5104: _L_z04_CheckBigDigdoggerCollisions_LoopCornerCollision:
                            	  5105:     ; Digdogger is big, but room boundary checks and
                            	  5106:     ; object collision checks assume a 16x16 monster or smaller.
                            	  5107:     ; Therefore, we have to check these things four times,
                            	  5108:     ; in different corners of the boss.
                            	  5109:     ;
                            	  5110:     ; Loop 4 times, from 0 to 3.
                            	  5111:     ;
